[00:02.581]Better times are waiting for you
{"美好时光正等待着你"}
[00:06.747]Filled with surprise like a kaleidoscope
{"如万花筒般充满惊喜"}
[00:09.963]What waits ahead, you will never know
{"前方等待的永远未知"}
[00:16.348]Every morning you wish this could be a better day
{"每个清晨你都期盼今天会更好"}
[00:19.747]Till the rains pouring down from the sky and you sigh
{"直到大雨倾盆落下你轻声叹息"}
[00:23.183]"How come things never truly work out for me"
{"「为何事事总难如我所愿」"}
[00:26.885]You want to make a change
{"你渴望做出改变"}
[00:30.179]See the sun rise and fall but everything is the same
{"看日出日落却一切如常"}
[00:33.669]Wonder how everyone keeps stepping up their game
{"疑惑他人如何不断突破"}
[00:37.373]This puzzle of life's right there for you
{"人生的拼图就在你面前"}
[00:41.056]The missing pieces are hard to find
{"缺失的碎片难以寻觅"}
[00:44.607]You know you really gotta take it easy
{"你明白该放轻松些"}
[00:46.458]When you're feeling lonely
{"当你感到孤独时"}
[00:47.716]Just open up your heart
{"只需敞开心扉"}
[00:49.604]I am right here for you
{"我会一直在这里"}
[00:51.289]You know you better keep it simple baby
{"亲爱的你该保持简单"}
[00:53.757]No complexity
{"不必复杂纠结"}
[00:54.797]You don't know how much you mean to me
{"你不知对我多重要"}
[00:58.026]I'll be the brightest star and light up the dark of night
{"我会成为最亮的星照亮黑夜"}
[01:02.167]I'll take you to the clearest side of the sky
{"带你飞向最澄澈的天际"}
[01:05.831]Whichever song that makes you smile
{"任何能让你微笑的歌"}
[01:07.874]I'll sing it for you
{"我都为你唱起"}
[01:11.829]No sorrow lasts forever and you'll be alright
{"悲伤不会永驻 你会好起来"}
[01:12.751]Cause I'm lighting up the fireworks for you tonight
{"因为今夜我为你点燃烟花"}
[01:16.262]The missing parts of the kaleidoscope we'll get'em back
{"我们会找回万花筒缺失的色彩"}
[01:20.476]The patterns' keep on changing don't miss a chance
{"变幻的图案永不停歇　别错过任何机遇"}
[01:23.298]To share every view with me I wanna see through your eyes
{"与我分享每个视角　我渴望透过你的眼睛看世界"}
[01:43.019]Better times are waiting for you
{"更美好的时光正等待着你"}
[01:44.974]show the world to your tender soul
{"向世界展示你柔韧的灵魂"}
[01:48.470]Can't you tell our bond is so strong
{"难道你感受不到我们之间牢不可破的羁绊"}
[01:58.819]Take my hand you're never along
{"握住我的手　你永远不会独行"}
[01:59.051]You know I'll be the brightest star and light up the the dark for tonight
{"今夜我将化作最亮的星　为你照亮黑暗"}
[02:02.530]I'll take you to the clearest side of the sky
{"我会带你飞向天空最澄澈的彼端"}
[02:06.366]Whichever song that makes you smile
{"无论哪首歌能让你展露笑颜"}
[02:07.738]I'll sing it for you
{"我都愿为你吟唱"}
[02:09.313]But don't you know how much you mean to me
{"可你难道不明白你对我有多重要"}
[02:12.618]Cause you'll be the brightest star and light up the day
{"因为你终将成为最亮的星　照亮白昼"}
[02:16.296]The missing parts of the kaleidoscope are in your hand
{"万花筒缺失的碎片正握在你掌心"}
[02:20.346]The patterns' keep on changing don't miss a chance
{"变幻的图案永不停歇　别错过任何机遇"}
[02:23.483]To share every view with me I wanna see through your eyes
{"与我分享每个视角　我渴望透过你的眼睛看世界"}
[02:28.412]Better times are waiting for you
{"更美好的时光正等待着你"}
[02:30.213](Just for you)
{"（只为你）"}
[02:31.677]Filled with surprise like a kaleidoscope
{"如同万花筒般充满惊喜"}
[02:34.844]You're never truly along
{"你永远不会真正孤单"}
[02:37.840]Wherever you go
{"无论你去往何方"}
[02:41.076]You will have my heart here for you
{"我的心永远在这里守候着你"}
